# Normalize all text to LF in the repository and in working trees.
# Linux CI is authoritative; CRLF checkouts make gofmt and shell scripts fail
# locally in ways CI cannot reproduce.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary declarations so git never applies line-ending filters.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gguf binary
